       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     TLOADDESM.
       AUTHOR.         JEFF BUNGO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   OCTOBER 1997.
       DATE-COMPILED.

      *D THIS PROGRAM WAS WRITTEN TO LOAD THE MP1 INFORMATION FOR THE
      *D DES MOINES DISTRIBUTION CENTER FROM DATA PROVIDED BY GBS.
      *D THIS IS TO BE USED AS AN INITIAL LOAD PRIOR TO CSIS STARTUP.
      *

      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
      *C  02/07/00     CA YODER
      *C     CHANGED PROGRAM TO PUT USAGE IN CORRECT FIELDS.  THE
      *C     FIRST BUCKET IS THE MTD TOTAL; PRIOR TO THIS CHANGE, IT
      *C     WAS BEING MOVED TO THE JANUARY TOTAL.  THIS CAUSED THE
      *C     USAGE TOTALS TO BE ONE MONTH OFF.
      *C
      *C  11/14/01     CA YODER
      *C     WITH MOVE FROM GBS TO SAP R/3, THE NEW DOWNLOAD FILE
      *C     COULD NO LONGER SUPPLY PURCHASING GROUP.  CHANGED PROGRAM
      *C     TO IGNORE THIS FIELD.
      *C
      *C     SINCE PURCHASING GROUP WAS MOVED TO DEFAULT DEPARTMENT AND
      *C     PURCHASING GROUP NAME WAS MOVED TO ORIGINATOR IN MSTORERM,
      *C     CHECK TO SEE IF THESE FIELDS ALREADY HAVE VALUES IN MSTORERM
      *C     FOR AN EXISTING CODE.  IF NOT, MOVE SPACES.  OTHERWISE,
      *C     DO NOT CHANGE THE VALUE IN MSTORERM.
      *C
      *C  11/28/01     CA YODER
      *C     CHANGED FIELD DEFINITIONS IN SAP RECORD LAYOUT BECAUSE
      *C     SAP NO LONGER SENDING PACKED DECIMAL FIELDS.
      *C
      *C  11/29/01     CA YODER
      *C     AVERAGE COST NO LONGER PROVIDED IN SAP; ONLY ONE COST
      *C     EXISTS.  PUT THE SAME VALUE IN STANDARD AND AVERAGE
      *C     COST FIELDS FOR MP1.
      *C
      *C  02/21/02     CA YODER
      *C     ADDED CALCULATIONS TO DETERMINE MAX, REORD, EXPEDITE, AND
      *C     SOQ FIELDS INSTEAD OF USING VALUES PROVIDED BY SAP.
      *C
      *C  10/10/2002   CA YODER
      *C     MADE CHANGES TO MODIFY ONLY CODES WHICH HAVE NOT YET BEEN
      *C     INITIALIZED (REORDER = 0) FOR A 2ND LOAD OF DESM DATA FROM
      *C     SAP.  HARD-CODED SOME VALUES AS REQUESTED BY THE USER.
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT MSTORERM
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDESC
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT USAGEFIL
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSAG
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT GBSLOAD
               ASSIGN TO DISK-GBSLOAD
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT ERROR-REPORT
               ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  MSTORERM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0201.

       FD  DDESC
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDESC-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1401.

       FD  USAGEFIL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  USAGEFIL-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCSUSAG  OF MCFLCSUSAG.

       FD  GBSLOAD
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS GBSLOAD-REC.
       01  GBSLOAD-REC.
           05  FILLER               PIC X(1).
           05  GBS-PRODUCT-CODE.
               10  GBS-PRODUCT-CODE-1 PIC X(3).
               10  GBS-PRODUCT-CODE-2 PIC X(3).
               10  GBS-PRODUCT-CODE-3 PIC X(3).
               10  GBS-PRODUCT-CODE-4 PIC X(5).
           05  GBS-REC-ID           PIC X(1).
           05  GBS-DATA             PIC X(117).
           05  GBS-MP1 REDEFINES GBS-DATA.
               10  PURCH-GROUP      PIC X(3).
               10  GBS-CODE.
                   15  GBS-CODE-1   PIC X(2).
                   15  GBS-CODE-2   PIC X(6).
               10  GBS-DESC         PIC X(40).
               10  GBS-UM           PIC X(2).
               10  GBS-ONHAND       PIC 9(8).
               10  GBS-ONHAND-X REDEFINES GBS-ONHAND PIC X(8).
      *********10  GBS-ONHAND       PIC S9(8) COMP-3.
      *********10  GBS-ONHAND-X REDEFINES GBS-ONHAND PIC X(5).
               10  GBS-MAX          PIC 9(8).
               10  GBS-MAX-X REDEFINES GBS-MAX PIC X(8).
      *********10  GBS-MAX          PIC S9(8) COMP-3.
      *********10  GBS-MAX-X REDEFINES GBS-MAX PIC X(5).
               10  GBS-REORDER      PIC 9(8).
               10  GBS-REORDER-X REDEFINES GBS-REORDER PIC X(8).
      *********10  GBS-REORDER      PIC S9(8) COMP-3.
      *********10  GBS-REORDER-X REDEFINES GBS-REORDER PIC X(5).
               10  GBS-SAFETY       PIC 9(8).
               10  GBS-SAFETY-X REDEFINES GBS-SAFETY PIC X(8).
      *********10  GBS-SAFETY       PIC S9(8) COMP-3.
      *********10  GBS-SAFETY-X REDEFINES GBS-SAFETY PIC X(5).
               10  GBS-STD-PRICE    PIC 9(5)V9(2).
               10  GBS-STD-PRICE-X REDEFINES GBS-STD-PRICE PIC X(7).
      *********10  GBS-STD-PRICE    PIC S9(5)V9(2) COMP-3.
      *********10  GBS-STD-PRICE-X REDEFINES GBS-STD-PRICE PIC X(4).
      *********10  GBS-B300-PRICE   PIC S9(5)V9(2) COMP-3.
      *********10  GBS-B300-PRICE-X REDEFINES GBS-B300-PRICE PIC X(4).
      *********10  PURCH-GROUP-NAME PIC X(25).
               10  FILLER           PIC X(24).
           05  GBS-USAGE REDEFINES GBS-DATA.
      *---------- ASSUME USAGE STARTS WITH CURRENT MONTH
               10  GBS-USAGE-MONTHS OCCURS 13 TIMES.
                   15  GBS-USAGE-MTH PIC 9(5).
                   15  GBS-USAGE-MTH-X REDEFINES GBS-USAGE-MTH PIC X(5).
      *************15  GBS-USAGE-MTH PIC S9(8) COMP-3.
      *************15  GBS-USAGE-MTH-X REDEFINES GBS-USAGE-MTH PIC X(5).
               10  FILLER           PIC X(52).
      *********10  FILLER           PIC X(28).
       01  GBS-HEADER-REC REDEFINES GBSLOAD-REC.
           05  FILLER               PIC X(1).
           05  GBS-HEADER           PIC X(132).

       FD  ERROR-REPORT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS ERROR-REPORT-REC.
       01  ERROR-REPORT-REC   PIC X(132).


       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  PRODUCT-CODE-MFR     PIC X(26) VALUE "GOODYEAR PRODUCT CODE".
       77  GBS-CODE-MFR         PIC X(26) VALUE "GBS MATERIAL NUMBER".
       77  SUB                  PIC 9(2).
       77  HOLD-12-MO-USAGE     PIC 9(8)  VALUE 0.
       77  HOLD-VALUE           PIC 9(8)  VALUE 0.
       77  HOLD-DEC             PIC 9(7)V9 VALUE 0.
       77  HOLD-WHOLE-NUM       PIC 9(7)  VALUE 0.

       01  CODES-READ           PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.
       01  CODES-UPDATED        PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.
       01  USAGE-UPDATED        PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.
       01  CODES-IN-ERROR       PIC 9(6) VALUE ZERO.

       01  TEST-NUMERIC1        PIC 9(8).
       01  TEST-NUMERIC1-X REDEFINES TEST-NUMERIC1 PIC X(8).
       01  TEST-NUMERIC2        PIC 9(5)V9(2).
       01  TEST-NUMERIC2-X REDEFINES TEST-NUMERIC2 PIC X(7).

       01  EOF-SW                       PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
           88  EOF                               VALUE "Y".
       01  EDIT-ERROR-SW                PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
           88  EDIT-ERROR                        VALUE "Y".
       01  UPDATE-ERROR-SW              PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
           88  UPDATE-ERROR                      VALUE "Y".

       01  GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE.
           05  GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE-1      PIC X(3).
           05  FILLER                       PIC X(1) VALUE "-".
           05  GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE-2      PIC X(3).
           05  FILLER                       PIC X(1) VALUE "-".
           05  GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE-3      PIC X(3).
           05  FILLER                       PIC X(1) VALUE "-".
           05  GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE-4      PIC X(5).
       01  MFR-PART-NUMBER              PIC X(20).
       01  PRODUCT-CODE-CC              PIC X(8).
       01  GBS-CODE-CC                  PIC X(8).
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  DATABASE BUFFERS
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY MSTORERM      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DDESC         IN COPYLIB.
       COPY USAGEFIL      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CDESC         IN COPYLIB.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X  VALUE "0".

       COPY DATAB         IN COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  OUTPUT REPORT LINE
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  REPORT-HEADER.
           05  FILLER               PIC X(57) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER               PIC X(17) VALUE "MP1 LOAD FROM GBS".
           05  FILLER               PIC X(58) VALUE SPACES.
       01  ITEM-HEADER.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(7) VALUE " CSIS  ".
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(17) VALUE " PRODUCT CODE ".
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(8) VALUE "GBS CODE".
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(3) VALUE "GRP".
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(15) VALUE "GROUP NAME".
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(30) VALUE "DESCRIPTION".
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(40) VALUE "MESSAGE".
       01  REPORT-LINE.
           05  REPORT-CC                PIC X(7).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  REPORT-PRODUCT-CODE      PIC X(17).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  REPORT-GBS-CODE          PIC X(8).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  REPORT-GROUP             PIC X(3).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  REPORT-GROUP-NAME        PIC X(15).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  REPORT-DESC              PIC X(30).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  ERROR-MSG                PIC X(40).
       01  COUNT-LINE.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(12) VALUE "CODES READ: ".
           05  REPORT-CODES-READ        PIC Z(5)9(1).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(8)  VALUE "ERRORS: ".
           05  REPORT-CODES-IN-ERROR    PIC Z(5)9(1).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(15) VALUE "CODES UPDATED: ".
           05  REPORT-CODES-UPDATED     PIC Z(5)9(1).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(5).
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(15) VALUE "USAGE UPDATED: ".
           05  REPORT-USAGE-UPDATED     PIC Z(5)9(1).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(43) VALUE SPACES.


       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       1-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 10-HSK THRU 10-HSK-X.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X UNTIL EOF.
           PERFORM 11-EOJ THRU 11-EOJ-X.
           GOBACK.

       10-HSK.
           OPEN INPUT   GBSLOAD
           OPEN I-O     MSTORERM
                        DDESC
                        USAGEFIL.
           OPEN OUTPUT  ERROR-REPORT.

           WRITE ERROR-REPORT-REC FROM REPORT-HEADER.
           MOVE SPACES TO ERROR-REPORT-REC.
           WRITE ERROR-REPORT-REC FROM ITEM-HEADER.
           MOVE SPACES TO ERROR-REPORT-REC.

           PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X
             UNTIL EOF OR GBS-HEADER = "BEGIN GBS MATERIAL"
           IF NOT EOF
               PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X.
           ADD 1 TO CODES-READ.
       10-HSK-X.
           EXIT.

       11-EOJ.
           MOVE CODES-READ TO REPORT-CODES-READ.
           MOVE CODES-IN-ERROR TO REPORT-CODES-IN-ERROR.
           MOVE CODES-UPDATED TO REPORT-CODES-UPDATED.
           MOVE USAGE-UPDATED TO REPORT-USAGE-UPDATED.
           WRITE ERROR-REPORT-REC FROM COUNT-LINE
             AFTER ADVANCING 3 LINES.
           CLOSE        MSTORERM
                        DDESC
                        USAGEFIL
                        GBSLOAD
                        ERROR-REPORT.
       11-EOJ-X.
           EXIT.

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "N" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW.
           MOVE "N" TO UPDATE-ERROR-SW.
           MOVE 0   TO HOLD-12-MO-USAGE.
           PERFORM 62-EDIT-MP1 THRU 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           IF NOT EDIT-ERROR
               PERFORM 63-UPDATE-MP1 THRU 63-UPDATE-MP1-X
               IF NOT UPDATE-ERROR
                 MOVE "SUCCESSFULLY UPDATED MP1" TO ERROR-MSG
                 ADD 1 TO CODES-UPDATED
                 PERFORM 64-UPDATE-DDESC THRU 64-UPDATE-DDESC-X
                 IF NOT UPDATE-ERROR
                   PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X
                   IF GBS-REC-ID NOT = "2"
                     MOVE "NO USAGE DATA READ." TO ERROR-MSG
                     PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
                     ADD 1 TO CODES-READ
                     GO TO 6-MAIN-X
                   ELSE
                     PERFORM 65-EDIT-USAGE THRU 65-EDIT-USAGE-X
                      VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                        UNTIL SUB > 13 OR EDIT-ERROR
                     IF NOT EDIT-ERROR
                       PERFORM 68-ADD-USAGE THRU 68-ADD-USAGE-X
                           VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 13
                       PERFORM 69-UPDATE-MP1-B THRU 69-UPDATE-MP1-B-X
                       IF NOT UPDATE-ERROR
                         MOVE "SUCCESSFULLY UPDATED MP1 B INFO"
                             TO ERROR-MSG
                       ELSE
                         PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
                       END-IF
                       PERFORM 66-UPDATE-USAGE THRU 66-UPDATE-USAGE-X
                       IF NOT UPDATE-ERROR
                         MOVE "SUCCESSFULLY UPDATED USAGE" TO ERROR-MSG
                         ADD 1 TO USAGE-UPDATED
                       ELSE
                         PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
                       END-IF
                     ELSE
                       PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
                     END-IF
                   END-IF
                 ELSE
                   PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
      *-----------SKIP REC-ID "2" IF ERROR IN "1"
                   PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X
                   IF GBS-REC-ID NOT = "2"
                     MOVE "NO USAGE DATA READ." TO ERROR-MSG
                     PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
                     ADD 1 TO CODES-READ
                     GO TO 6-MAIN-X
                   END-IF
                 END-IF
               ELSE
                 PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
      *-----------SKIP REC-ID "2" IF ERROR IN "1"
                 PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X
                 IF GBS-REC-ID NOT = "2"
                   MOVE "NO USAGE DATA READ." TO ERROR-MSG
                   PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
                   ADD 1 TO CODES-READ
                   GO TO 6-MAIN-X
                 END-IF
               END-IF
           ELSE
               PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
      *-----------SKIP REC-ID "2" IF ERROR IN "1"
               PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X
               IF GBS-REC-ID NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "NO USAGE DATA READ." TO ERROR-MSG
                 PERFORM 67-WRITE-REPORT THRU 67-WRITE-REPORT-X
                 ADD 1 TO CODES-READ
                 GO TO 6-MAIN-X
               END-IF
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X.
           IF GBS-HEADER = "END GBS MATERIAL"
               PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X
                 UNTIL EOF OR GBS-HEADER = "BEGIN GBS MATERIAL"
               IF NOT EOF
                   PERFORM 61-READ-GBS THRU 61-READ-GBS-X.
           IF NOT EOF AND GBS-REC-ID = "1"
               ADD 1 TO CODES-READ.
       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       61-READ-GBS.
           READ GBSLOAD AT END
               MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1"
               MOVE "Y" TO  EOF-SW.
       61-READ-GBS-X.
           EXIT.

       62-EDIT-MP1.
           MOVE "N" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW.
           MOVE 0 TO CDESC-LINES-TO-GET.
           MOVE SPACES TO PRODUCT-CODE-CC.
           MOVE SPACES TO GBS-CODE-CC.

      *------FIND GBS GOODYEAR PRODUCT CODE
           IF GBS-PRODUCT-CODE = SPACES
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "BLANK GOODYEAR PRODUCT CODE." TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           MOVE GBS-PRODUCT-CODE-1 TO GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE-1.
           MOVE GBS-PRODUCT-CODE-2 TO GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE-2.
           MOVE GBS-PRODUCT-CODE-3 TO GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE-3.
           MOVE GBS-PRODUCT-CODE-4 TO GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE-4.

           MOVE "00" TO CDESC-RET-CODE.
           MOVE GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE TO MFR-PART-NUMBER
           CALL "CMFRCDESC" USING PRODUCT-CODE-MFR
                                  MFR-PART-NUMBER
                                  PRODUCT-CODE-CC
                                  CDESC-RET-CODE
                                  CDESC-DATA.
           IF CDESC-RET-CODE NOT = "00"
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "GOODYEAR PRODUCT CODE NOT CSIS CODED."
                  TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.

      *------FIND GBS MATERIAL NUMBER
           IF GBS-CODE = SPACES
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "BLANK GBS MATERIAL NUMBER." TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           MOVE "00" TO CDESC-RET-CODE.
           MOVE GBS-CODE-2 TO MFR-PART-NUMBER.
           CALL "CMFRCDESC" USING GBS-CODE-MFR
                                  MFR-PART-NUMBER
                                  GBS-CODE-CC
                                  CDESC-RET-CODE
                                  CDESC-DATA.
           IF CDESC-RET-CODE NOT = "00"
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "GBS MATERIAL NUMBER NOT CSIS CODED."
                  TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.

      *------MAKE SURE CODES HAVE SAME CORPORATE CODE
           IF PRODUCT-CODE-CC NOT = GBS-CODE-CC
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "GBS CODE AND GDYR CODE HAVE DIFFERECNT CSIS CODE"
                TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.

      *------CHECK REQUIRED FIELDS
      *------------ IGNORE PURCHASING GROUP.
      *    IF PURCH-GROUP = SPACES
      *       MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
      *       MOVE "BLANK PURCHASING GROUP" TO ERROR-MSG
      *       GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
      *    IF PURCH-GROUP-NAME = SPACES
      *       MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
      *       MOVE "BLANK PURCHASING GROUP NAME" TO ERROR-MSG
      *       GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           IF GBS-ONHAND NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "ONHAND NOT NUMERIC" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           IF GBS-DESC = SPACES
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "BLANK GBS DESCRIPTION" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           IF GBS-UM = SPACES
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "BLANK UNIT OF MEASURE" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
      *    MOVE GBS-B300-PRICE TO TEST-NUMERIC1.
      *    IF TEST-NUMERIC1-X NOT NUMERIC
      *       MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
      *       MOVE "B300 PRICE NOT NUMERIC" TO ERROR-MSG
      *       GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           MOVE GBS-STD-PRICE TO TEST-NUMERIC1.
           IF TEST-NUMERIC1-X NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "GBS STD PRICE NOT NUMERIC" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           MOVE GBS-REORDER TO TEST-NUMERIC2.
           IF TEST-NUMERIC2-X NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "REORDER NOT NUMERIC" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           MOVE GBS-SAFETY TO TEST-NUMERIC2.
           IF TEST-NUMERIC2-X NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "SAFETY STOCK NOT NUMERIC" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           MOVE GBS-MAX TO TEST-NUMERIC2.
           IF TEST-NUMERIC2-X NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "MAX NOT NUMERIC" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 62-EDIT-MP1-X.
       62-EDIT-MP1-X.
           EXIT.

       63-UPDATE-MP1.
           MOVE GBS-CODE-CC TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC.
           READ MSTORERM INTO BUF-MSTORERM.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "Y" TO UPDATE-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "ERROR READING CSIS CODE FOR UPDATE" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 63-UPDATE-MP1-X.
           IF STR-REORDER = 0
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              MOVE "Y" TO UPDATE-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "REORDER NOT = 0; NO UPDATES DONE" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 63-UPDATE-MP1-X.
           MOVE "791   "         TO STR-DFLT-DEPT.
           MOVE "799 "           TO STR-CLASS.
      **   IF STR-DFLT-DEPT > SPACES
      **       NEXT SENTENCE
      **   ELSE
      *****MOVE PURCH-GROUP      TO STR-DFLT-DEPT.
      **   MOVE SPACES           TO STR-DFLT-DEPT.
           IF STR-AUTHOR > SPACES
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
      *****MOVE PURCH-GROUP-NAME TO STR-AUTHOR.
           MOVE SPACES           TO STR-AUTHOR.
           MOVE GBS-ONHAND       TO STR-ONHAND
                                    STR-LOC-ONHAND(1).
           MOVE "NEW 10/02"      TO STR-LOC (1).
           MOVE GBS-UM           TO STR-UM.
      *****MOVE GBS-B300-PRICE   TO STR-AVG-COST.
           MOVE GBS-STD-PRICE    TO STR-STD-COST
                                    STR-AVG-COST.
      *****MOVE GBS-REORDER      TO STR-REORDER.
      *****MOVE GBS-SAFETY       TO STR-EXPEDITE.
      *****MOVE GBS-MAX          TO STR-MAX.
           REWRITE MSTORERM-REC FROM BUF-MSTORERM.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "Y" TO UPDATE-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "ERROR WRITING CSIS CODE FOR UPDATE" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 63-UPDATE-MP1-X.
       63-UPDATE-MP1-X.
           EXIT.

       64-UPDATE-DDESC.
           MOVE GBS-CODE-CC TO CORPCDE OF DDESC-REC.
           MOVE "99" TO DESCIDNUM OF DDESC-REC.
           READ DDESC INTO BUF-DDESC.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE GBS-CODE-CC TO DESC-CORP-CODE
               MOVE "99"        TO DESC-ID-NUM
               MOVE GBS-DESC    TO DESC-DATA
               WRITE DDESC-REC FROM BUF-DDESC
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "Y" TO UPDATE-ERROR-SW
                   MOVE "ERROR WRITING CSIS DDESC" TO ERROR-MSG
                   GO TO 64-UPDATE-DDESC-X
               END-IF
           ELSE
               MOVE GBS-DESC    TO DESC-DATA
               REWRITE DDESC-REC FROM BUF-DDESC
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "Y" TO UPDATE-ERROR-SW
                   MOVE "ERROR REWRITING CSIS DDESC" TO ERROR-MSG
                   GO TO 64-UPDATE-DDESC-X
               END-IF
           END-IF.
       64-UPDATE-DDESC-X.
           EXIT.

       65-EDIT-USAGE.
      *------ALL USAGE MUST BE NUMERIC
           MOVE GBS-USAGE-MTH (SUB) TO TEST-NUMERIC2.
           IF TEST-NUMERIC2-X NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "USAGE VALUE NOT NUMERIC" TO ERROR-MSG.
       65-EDIT-USAGE-X.
           EXIT.

       66-UPDATE-USAGE.
           MOVE GBS-CODE-CC TO CORPCDE OF USAGEFIL-REC.
           READ USAGEFIL INTO BUF-USAGEFIL.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE GBS-CODE-CC TO K-CORP-CODE
               PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                 UNTIL SUB > 13
                   IF SUB = 1
                       MOVE GBS-USAGE-MTH(SUB) TO K-MTH-USAGE(13)
                   ELSE
                       MOVE GBS-USAGE-MTH(SUB) TO K-MTH-USAGE(SUB - 1)
                   END-IF
               END-PERFORM
               MOVE ZEROS TO K-MTH-USAGE(14)
               WRITE USAGEFIL-REC FROM BUF-USAGEFIL
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
                   MOVE "ERROR WRITING CSIS USAGE" TO ERROR-MSG
               END-IF
           ELSE
               PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                 UNTIL SUB > 13
                   IF SUB = 1
                       MOVE GBS-USAGE-MTH(SUB) TO K-MTH-USAGE(13)
                   ELSE
                       MOVE GBS-USAGE-MTH(SUB) TO K-MTH-USAGE(SUB - 1)
                   END-IF
               END-PERFORM
               MOVE ZEROS TO K-MTH-USAGE(14)
               REWRITE USAGEFIL-REC FROM BUF-USAGEFIL
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "Y" TO EDIT-ERROR-SW
                   MOVE "ERROR REWRITING CSIS USAGE" TO ERROR-MSG
               END-IF
           END-IF.
       66-UPDATE-USAGE-X.
           EXIT.

       67-WRITE-REPORT.
           MOVE PRODUCT-CODE-CC TO REPORT-CC.
           MOVE GOODYEAR-PRODUCT-CODE TO REPORT-PRODUCT-CODE.
           MOVE GBS-CODE TO REPORT-GBS-CODE.
           MOVE SPACES      TO REPORT-GROUP
                               REPORT-GROUP-NAME.
      *****MOVE PURCH-GROUP TO REPORT-GROUP.
      *****MOVE PURCH-GROUP-NAME TO REPORT-GROUP-NAME.
           MOVE GBS-DESC TO REPORT-DESC.
           WRITE ERROR-REPORT-REC FROM REPORT-LINE
             AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO ERROR-REPORT-REC REPORT-LINE.
           ADD 1 TO CODES-IN-ERROR.
       67-WRITE-REPORT-X.
           EXIT.

       68-ADD-USAGE.
           MOVE GBS-USAGE-MTH (SUB) TO TEST-NUMERIC2.
           IF TEST-NUMERIC2-X NUMERIC
              ADD GBS-USAGE-MTH (SUB)  TO  HOLD-12-MO-USAGE.
       68-ADD-USAGE-X.
           EXIT.

       69-UPDATE-MP1-B.
           MOVE GBS-CODE-CC TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC.
           READ MSTORERM INTO BUF-MSTORERM.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "Y" TO UPDATE-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "ERROR READING CSIS CODE FOR UPDATE-B" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 69-UPDATE-MP1-B-X.
           COMPUTE HOLD-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-12-MO-USAGE * 2.
           PERFORM 70-ROUND-NUM THRU 70-ROUND-NUM-X.
           MOVE HOLD-VALUE       TO STR-MAX.

           COMPUTE HOLD-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-12-MO-USAGE / 4.
           PERFORM 70-ROUND-NUM THRU 70-ROUND-NUM-X.
           MOVE HOLD-VALUE       TO STR-REORDER.

           COMPUTE HOLD-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-12-MO-USAGE / 8.
           PERFORM 70-ROUND-NUM THRU 70-ROUND-NUM-X.
           MOVE HOLD-VALUE       TO STR-EXPEDITE.

           COMPUTE HOLD-VALUE ROUNDED = HOLD-12-MO-USAGE.
           PERFORM 70-ROUND-NUM THRU 70-ROUND-NUM-X.
           MOVE HOLD-VALUE       TO STR-SOQ.

           REWRITE MSTORERM-REC FROM BUF-MSTORERM.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "Y" TO UPDATE-ERROR-SW
              MOVE "ERROR WRITING CSIS CODE FOR UPDATE-B" TO ERROR-MSG
              GO TO 69-UPDATE-MP1-B-X.

       69-UPDATE-MP1-B-X.
           EXIT.

       70-ROUND-NUM.
           COMPUTE HOLD-DEC = HOLD-VALUE / 10.
           COMPUTE HOLD-WHOLE-NUM ROUNDED = HOLD-DEC.
           COMPUTE HOLD-WHOLE-NUM = HOLD-WHOLE-NUM * 10.
           MOVE HOLD-WHOLE-NUM TO HOLD-VALUE.
       70-ROUND-NUM-X.
           EXIT.

